Package: pqverse
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'pqverse'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Adrien", "Taudière", email = "adrien.taudiere@zaclys.net",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1088-1182"))
Description: The 'pqverse' is a set of packages for metabarcoding analysis
    that share the phyloseq object as their central data structure. This
    package makes it easy to install and load multiple 'pqverse' packages
    in a single step.
License: AGPL-3
URL: https://adrientaudiere.github.io/pqverse/,
    https://github.com/adrientaudiere/pqverse
BugReports: https://github.com/adrientaudiere/pqverse/issues
